    },
    {
      "id": "rKL6soAnnc9qhQwL-rkgf",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2145.405856724431,
      "y": 620.4575433269366,
      "width": 1042.89892578125,
      "height": 150,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "XXy48Q4tbQa3whBbhNTe5"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b2N",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 626051021,
      "version": 3331,
      "versionNonce": 344216960,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1763641927110,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The main component of the serving system is the scheduler, which is responsible for creating a batch of \nrequests by retrieving requests from a queue and a scheduling the execution engine to process the batch. \nThe execution engine  processes the received batch by running multiple iterations of the model\nbeing served and returns the generated text back to the serving system.\n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "The main component of the serving system is the scheduler, which is responsible for creating a batch of \nrequests by retrieving requests from a queue and a scheduling the execution engine to process the batch. \nThe execution engine  processes the received batch by running multiple iterations of the model\nbeing served and returns the generated text back to the serving system.\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "Me0OIauC9Ohwoi7uaFRgu",
